{"createdAt":1785080681386,"expiresAt":1785167081386,"key":"https://store.steampowered.com/api/appdetails?appids=3361510&filters=basic%2Cprice_overview%2Crelease_date%2Cplatforms%2Cdemos%2Cgenres&cc=MY&l=english","data":{"3361510":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Coal LLC","steam_appid":3361510,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<h1>Now with hard mode modifiers!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Why must we fill the quotas of our corporate overlords so... <strong>easily</strong>?&quot;, </i>Dennis the dog asks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Well now you can suffer a little bit more with the new Hard Mode Modifiers! Challenge yourself to one of four (so far) enhanced difficulty modes and earn in-game badges for surviving with each profession.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hooray!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361510/extras/adc66ddd351718bde4b0f054c15fe496.poster.avif?t=1776327387\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361510/extras/adc66ddd351718bde4b0f054c15fe496.webm?t=1776327387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361510/extras/adc66ddd351718bde4b0f054c15fe496.mp4?t=1776327387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Coal LLC, your friendly-everyday-evil-coal-mining-corporation. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With only a shoddy pickaxe to start, you must hire and promote employees, upgrade equipment and dig deep below the earth to fill your coal quota each day. Or else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361510/extras/b2006937c79e46504300df0439480d2f.poster.avif?t=1776327387\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361510/extras/b2006937c79e46504300df0439480d2f.webm?t=1776327387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361510/extras/b2006937c79e46504300df0439480d2f.mp4?t=1776327387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Feed the factories.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The underground world magically refreshes each day, so you must race to mine as much of it and as deeply as you can before nightfall. Using some very exciting and <i>hyper-realistic</i> methods for doing so. Your world might deteriorate as you grow, however.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361510/extras/499d1003e83fc8dd6215ba22c47362f0.poster.avif?t=1776327387\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361510/extras/499d1003e83fc8dd6215ba22c47362f0.webm?t=1776327387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361510/extras/499d1003e83fc8dd6215ba22c47362f0.mp4?t=1776327387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hire BILLIONS  of employees.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You heard that right. Hire and promote employees into specialised roles in your organisation, each type having exciting and game-changing bonuses and equipment. Grow your organisation into hundreds, thousands, millions and even <strong><i>billions </i></strong>of miners willing to go out and bring back coal for the cause.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361510/extras/0fbf32e6caf489dc9c8262019020bb67.poster.avif?t=1776327387\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361510/extras/0fbf32e6caf489dc9c8262019020bb67.webm?t=1776327387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361510/extras/0fbf32e6caf489dc9c8262019020bb67.mp4?t=1776327387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Don't be afraid of the consequences.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many different maps, professions and tools means endless ways of growing your operation.  Do you have what it takes to grow the greatest coal mining corporation of all time?</p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361510/extras/adc66ddd351718bde4b0f054c15fe496.poster.avif?t=1776327387\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361510/extras/adc66ddd351718bde4b0f054c15fe496.webm?t=1776327387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361510/extras/adc66ddd351718bde4b0f054c15fe496.mp4?t=1776327387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Coal LLC, your friendly-everyday-evil-coal-mining-corporation. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With only a shoddy pickaxe to start, you must hire and promote employees, upgrade equipment and dig deep below the earth to fill your coal quota each day. Or else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph